SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Thursday June 4th)
  
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Love Songs that Stir the Soul.**\n\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWo
 nderful new songs every week!\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time af
 ter 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\\*You are also welcome to come on later in th
 e evening as well\n\\*\\*If it's your first time attending- come for free 
 if you like (if you've been out before- please make a small contribution t
 o support the evening and the music)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\
 ,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist)\n\nEvent Details:\
 n**Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*O
 riginal lyrics and fully produced songs by Songwriter and Lyricist Steve F
 lemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, spiritual songs\, and many other 
 fun surprises!\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs using a fusion of mixed g
 enres like\, So please sit back and get ready to have an amazing auditory 
 experience in the comforts of your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on and o
 ff at any time during the night- starting at 9:00 pm\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\nFree if it's your first time attending online wi
 th me :)\n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e t
 ransfer or pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can
  contribute is greatly appreciated to help support this meaningful musical
  endeavor and song loving community\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04we
 b.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimonials from Past Events:**\n\nSteve Flemming is
  an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the soul. He transforms everyday 
 thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and magical tunes. Amazing stuff y
 et again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a night of heartfelt\, exhil
 arating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks for having me my friend. I lo
 ve your words\, they calm me and energize me at the same time I'll look fo
 rward to your next invite\nM.Z.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-
